274	     * Derives the owner's {@code identityKey}, the single value into which duplicate detection is
275	     * consolidated: the SHA-256 hex over
276	     * {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + lowerEmail + '|' + soundex(lastName)}.
277	     */
